  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Imagine a different world, where every Barcelona league title from the Negreira years went to the team in second.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "title",
        "heading": "WHAT IF…",
        "sub": "An imagined alternate world",
        "pill": "PURE IMAGINATION"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "To be clear: this never happened. No court has taken a title away, and Barcelona deny any wrongdoing.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "This is not real",
        "body": "An alternate world for fun. No ruling has found any result was affected. Every title still stands."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Between two thousand and one and twenty eighteen, Barça won nine leagues. Real Madrid were second in eight.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "The real world",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "9",
            "l": "Barça titles"
          },
          {
            "n": "8",
            "l": "Madrid second"
          },
          {
            "n": "1",
            "l": "Atlético second"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Real world today: Real Madrid thirty-six titles, Barcelona twenty-nine.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "versus",
        "title": "La Liga titles",
        "left": {
          "person": "ronaldo",
          "label": "Real Madrid",
          "value": "36"
        },
        "right": {
          "person": "messi",
          "label": "Barcelona",
          "value": "29"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In our alternate world, Madrid pick up eight more. That's forty-four.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "whatif",
        "title": "Real Madrid's titles",
        "real": {
          "label": "Real Madrid",
          "value": "36"
        },
        "alt": {
          "label": "Real Madrid",
          "value": "44"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Barcelona drop to twenty. The gap goes from seven to twenty-four.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "whatif",
        "title": "Barcelona's titles",
        "real": {
          "label": "Barcelona",
          "value": "29"
        },
        "alt": {
          "label": "Barcelona",
          "value": "20"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Atlético get twenty eighteen, and go from eleven titles to twelve.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "whatif",
        "title": "Atlético's titles",
        "real": {
          "label": "Atlético Madrid",
          "value": "11"
        },
        "alt": {
          "label": "Atlético Madrid",
          "value": "12"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Now the fun part. Cristiano Ronaldo won two leagues in nine years at Madrid.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "ronaldo",
        "label": "2 LEAGUES AT MADRID",
        "mood": "flat"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In this world? Seven.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "whatif",
        "title": "Ronaldo's La Liga titles",
        "real": {
          "label": "Ronaldo at Madrid",
          "value": "2"
        },
        "alt": {
          "label": "Ronaldo at Madrid",
          "value": "7"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And Lionel Messi, ten La Liga titles in real life, would have just one: twenty nineteen.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "whatif",
        "title": "Messi's La Liga titles",
        "real": {
          "label": "Messi",
          "value": "10"
        },
        "alt": {
          "label": "Messi",
          "value": "1"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A totally different history of Spanish football.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "trophies",
        "title": "Alternate champions",
        "items": [
          {
            "kind": "league",
            "label": "Madrid ×8"
          },
          {
            "kind": "league",
            "label": "Atlético ×1"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "But that world is made up. Back in this one, every title stands, there's no verdict, and the case is still open.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "IMAGINED",
        "color": "white"
